  outcome   : subject-level MAX AESEV over all graded AE records (1<2<3<4)
  analysis  : subjects with >=1 graded AE (ungraded subjects EXCLUDED from primary)
  exposure  : TRTGRP=="BCG" (reference = Placebo)
