              (nulls = absent; MHONGO excluded from count)
  covariate : patients_seen band midpoint (25.5/75.5/125.5), CENTRED on analysis mean
  model     : proportional-odds cumulative logit (ordered logistic), logit link
Outputs every table the researcher asked for under analysis/results/.
Read-only w.r.t. data/. Run: python3 analysis/run_final_model.py
"""
